sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor L as Learner
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant M as Email Service
    actor G as Guardian

    F->>API: POST /api/guardian-consents - guardian_email
    API->>DB: insert row - status pending, signed token
    API->>M: queue ConsentRequestMail
    M->>G: email with approve and decline links
    API-->>F: 202 accepted

    loop every 10 seconds while on ConsentPendingScreen
        F->>API: GET /api/me + Bearer
        API->>DB: read consent_status
        DB-->>API: pending
        API-->>F: 200 - still pending
    end

    G->>API: GET /consent/approve/{token} - browser, no login
    API->>API: verify signature and expiry
    API->>DB: status granted, responded_at now, users.consent_status synced
    API-->>G: confirmation web page

    F->>API: GET /api/me + Bearer - next poll
    API-->>F: 200 - consent granted
    F->>L: AppShell unlocked
